Three orders on one $3\times 4$ grid; each cell shows when it is visited (green = first, amber = last). The snake flips direction every row; the spiral walks four walls inward; the zig-zag of Diagonal Traverse (@sec-mat-p1-diag) reads anti-diagonal bands $i+j = 0, 1, \dots$, upward on even bands (violet) and downward on odd ones (cyan).

