| Question about rectangles | 1-D question on `col` | Kernel | Total |
|---|---|---|---|
| largest sum | largest subarray sum | Kadane (@sec-dpi-p5) | $O(R^2C)$ |
| how many have sum $= t$ | subarrays with sum $= t$ | prefix sums + hash map (@sec-pref-hash) | $O(R^2C)$ |
| largest sum $\le k$ | largest subarray sum $\le k$ | prefix sums + sorted set | $O(R^2 C\log C)$ |
| how many have all four corners $= 1$ | pairs of columns with both cells $1$ | count $c$, add $\binom{c}{2}$ | $O(R^2C)$ |

